      ⍝ Bugs41 #51: a ⎕PLOT member attribute beyond the int range is a DOMAIN ERROR
      ⍝ (like the string form), not taken modulo 2⋆32




      PA.gui_driver←'ASCII' ◊ PA.terminal_rows←4294967303 ◊ PA.terminal_cols←20




      Z←PA ⎕PLOT 1 2 3 4
DOMAIN ERROR+
      Z←PA ⎕PLOT 1 2 3 4
        ^  ^

      )MORE
A ⎕PLOT B: integer value out of range in attribute A.terminal_rows



      )SIC




      )ERASE PA





